5	// header is present (see lib/geo-currency.ts), we resolve the visitor's country
6	// from their IP locally. geoip-lite ships its own country database, so there's
7	// no MaxMind license or per-request external API call. If Cloudflare (or nginx
8	// GeoIP) is added later, the header path wins and this never runs.
