37	 * literally contains the words `name="email"` and "uncontrolled". A tripwire
38	 * that greps raw source would match its own incident note and pass on broken
39	 * code, or match the note and fail on correct code. Either way it teaches people
40	 * to ignore it. These assertions look at what the file DOES.
