559	 * THE HAZARD CLASS ITSELF: every export of a "use server" module is a
560	 * network-callable endpoint
561	 *
562	 * This codebase has been bitten by this twice. `verifyTotpForUser` lived in
563	 * lib/actions-2fa.ts, so it was a registered action taking a caller-supplied
